From: mira <mira@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 03:23:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] [feature](be) add native stack collector API and
 orchestration

The shared seam for Phase 2 native-stack collection: parse_collect_options
(the only bad_request choke point), run_collection (a single-dump timed_mutex
gate, /proc/self/task tid selection, and ok/partial/timeout aggregation),
resolve_dsos (/proc/self/maps), serialize (the JSON contract), and the test
hooks. The per-variant collect step lives in a separate file.

Reference: docs/phase2-design.md "Common API".
